[
  {
    "text": "he came plodding to the\ninn door",
    "start_ind": 5017,
    "end_ind": 5049
  },
  {
    "text": "when my father appeared",
    "start_ind": 5756,
    "end_ind": 5779
  },
  {
    "text": "when it was brought to him",
    "start_ind": 5822,
    "end_ind": 5848
  },
  {
    "text": "bring up alongside and help\nup my chest",
    "start_ind": 6262,
    "end_ind": 6301
  },
  {
    "text": "The man who came\nwith the barrow",
    "start_ind": 6886,
    "end_ind": 6918
  },
  {
    "text": "the people who came\nabout our house",
    "start_ind": 7559,
    "end_ind": 7594
  },
  {
    "text": "seafaring men had gone by along the\nroad",
    "start_ind": 7688,
    "end_ind": 7728
  },
  {
    "text": "a seaman did put up at the Admiral Benbow",
    "start_ind": 7890,
    "end_ind": 7931
  },
  {
    "text": "he entered the\nparlour",
    "start_ind": 8055,
    "end_ind": 8077
  },
  {
    "text": "see him leap and run and pursue me over hedge and\nditch",
    "start_ind": 9222,
    "end_ind": 9277
  },
  {
    "text": "allow anyone to leave the inn",
    "start_ind": 10379,
    "end_ind": 10408
  },
  {
    "text": "reeled off to bed",
    "start_ind": 10446,
    "end_ind": 10463
  },
  {
    "text": "people would soon cease coming there",
    "start_ind": 10975,
    "end_ind": 11011
  },
  {
    "text": "sent shivering to their beds",
    "start_ind": 11052,
    "end_ind": 11080
  },
  {
    "text": "my poor\nfather out of the room",
    "start_ind": 11823,
    "end_ind": 11853
  },
  {
    "text": "Dr. Livesey came\nlate one afternoon to see the patient",
    "start_ind": 12728,
    "end_ind": 12782
  },
  {
    "text": "went into the parlour",
    "start_ind": 12825,
    "end_ind": 12846
  },
  {
    "text": "I\nfollowed him in",
    "start_ind": 12954,
    "end_ind": 12971
  },
  {
    "text": "he rode away",
    "start_ind": 15949,
    "end_ind": 15961
  },
  {
    "text": "set out down the\nbeach",
    "start_ind": 16819,
    "end_ind": 16841
  },
  {
    "text": "he strode off",
    "start_ind": 17035,
    "end_ind": 17048
  },
  {
    "text": "he turned the big rock",
    "start_ind": 17087,
    "end_ind": 17109
  },
  {
    "text": "a man stepped in",
    "start_ind": 17336,
    "end_ind": 17352
  },
  {
    "text": "I was going out of the room to fetch it",
    "start_ind": 17778,
    "end_ind": 17817
  },
  {
    "text": "he sat down upon a table",
    "start_ind": 17820,
    "end_ind": 17844
  },
  {
    "text": "motioned me to draw near",
    "start_ind": 17849,
    "end_ind": 17873
  },
  {
    "text": "Come here, sonny",
    "start_ind": 17926,
    "end_ind": 17942
  },
  {
    "text": "Come nearer here",
    "start_ind": 17955,
    "end_ind": 17971
  },
  {
    "text": "I took a step nearer.",
    "start_ind": 17975,
    "end_ind": 17996
  },
  {
    "text": "he was out walking",
    "start_ind": 18582,
    "end_ind": 18600
  },
  {
    "text": "how the captain was\nlikely to return",
    "start_ind": 18695,
    "end_ind": 18731
  },
  {
    "text": "I stepped out myself into\nthe road",
    "start_ind": 19240,
    "end_ind": 19274
  },
  {
    "text": "called me back",
    "start_ind": 19295,
    "end_ind": 19309
  },
  {
    "text": "I\nwas back again",
    "start_ind": 19476,
    "end_ind": 19492
  },
  {
    "text": "You and me’ll just go back into the\nparlour",
    "start_ind": 20077,
    "end_ind": 20120
  },
  {
    "text": "get behind the door",
    "start_ind": 20133,
    "end_ind": 20152
  },
  {
    "text": "the stranger backed along with me into the parlour",
    "start_ind": 20235,
    "end_ind": 20285
  },
  {
    "text": "put me\nbehind him in the corner",
    "start_ind": 20290,
    "end_ind": 20321
  },
  {
    "text": "in strode the captain",
    "start_ind": 20709,
    "end_ind": 20730
  },
  {
    "text": "marched straight across the room",
    "start_ind": 20803,
    "end_ind": 20835
  },
  {
    "text": "come for to see his old shipmate Billy, at the Admiral\nBenbow inn",
    "start_ind": 21490,
    "end_ind": 21555
  },
  {
    "text": "I returned with the rum",
    "start_ind": 22017,
    "end_ind": 22040
  },
  {
    "text": "He bade me go",
    "start_ind": 22246,
    "end_ind": 22259
  },
  {
    "text": "I left them together and retired into the bar",
    "start_ind": 22342,
    "end_ind": 22387
  },
  {
    "text": "Black\nDog in full flight",
    "start_ind": 22911,
    "end_ind": 22935
  },
  {
    "text": "the captain hotly pursuing",
    "start_ind": 22941,
    "end_ind": 22967
  },
  {
    "text": "disappeared over the edge of the hill",
    "start_ind": 23451,
    "end_ind": 23488
  },
  {
    "text": "turned back into\nthe house.",
    "start_ind": 23652,
    "end_ind": 23679
  },
  {
    "text": "I must get away from here",
    "start_ind": 23840,
    "end_ind": 23865
  },
  {
    "text": "I ran to fetch it",
    "start_ind": 23879,
    "end_ind": 23896
  },
  {
    "text": "running\nin",
    "start_ind": 24080,
    "end_ind": 24090
  },
  {
    "text": "came running\ndownstairs to help me",
    "start_ind": 24211,
    "end_ind": 24245
  },
  {
    "text": "Doctor Livesey\ncame in",
    "start_ind": 24807,
    "end_ind": 24829
  },
  {
    "text": "you run upstairs",
    "start_ind": 25074,
    "end_ind": 25090
  },
  {
    "text": "Jim, you get me a basin.",
    "start_ind": 25228,
    "end_ind": 25252
  },
  {
    "text": "I got back with the basin",
    "start_ind": 25259,
    "end_ind": 25284
  },
  {
    "text": "I’ll help you to your bed",
    "start_ind": 27022,
    "end_ind": 27047
  },
  {
    "text": "we managed to hoist him upstairs",
    "start_ind": 27091,
    "end_ind": 27123
  },
  {
    "text": "laid him on his bed",
    "start_ind": 27129,
    "end_ind": 27148
  },
  {
    "text": "he went off to see my father",
    "start_ind": 27329,
    "end_ind": 27357
  },
  {
    "text": "taking me with him",
    "start_ind": 27359,
    "end_ind": 27377
  }
]